sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Authorized user
    participant UI as Party Detail UI (proposed)
    participant API as Members API (proposed)
    participant DB as ORM / PostgreSQL
    Note over UI,DB: US6 proposed - visibility and public-field allowlist require team decision
    U->>UI: Open members or refresh after approve/leave
    UI->>UI: Show loading
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/parties/{id}/members + session
    API->>API: Validate session and Party visibility policy
    alt Not logged in / forbidden / Party not found
        API-->>UI: Error per contract
        UI-->>U: Login / forbidden / not-found state
    else Authorized
        API->>DB: Read active memberships (left_at IS NULL), User/Profile and Host id
        Note over API,DB: Do not use Pending/Rejected requests as memberships, retain left history
        DB-->>API: Active rows including Host
        API->>API: Public allowlist + role + count, no email/student ID/token
        API-->>UI: Members + active count
        alt Empty or partial profile data
            UI-->>U: Empty state or safe display-name/avatar fallback
        else Members available
            UI-->>U: Host/Member badges and matching Party count
        end
    end
    Note over UI,API: Network/server failure shows retry state, no stale success representation
